    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You excel at deceiving others with your tricks and masterful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feint\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feint\">Feint</a> in combat.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can spend two successive <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> on the same turn to make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check against a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. If the check is successful, the target is <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a> against your next attack made before the end of your next turn. Additionally, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to extend your target's penalties until the end of encounter.</p>",
